 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Visit positions in order. An ad is eligible for a position if its prior display count (userAdState, missing = 0) is below its maxDisplay and it has not already been assigned earlier in this call. Randomness is injected: with eligible ads listed in candidateAds order, position i receives eligible[randomIndices[i] mod |eligible|]; a position with no eligible ad receives null. Returns one entry per position. Positions and adIds are unique; state entries for non-candidate ads are ignored.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
    "revision": null,
